# Isolated git worktrees created by Claude Code subagents. These are full
# checkouts of this same repo nested inside it (hundreds of MB) and are scratch
# space belonging to a running agent — never repo content. Scoped to
# `worktrees/` rather than all of `.claude/` so genuine committed project config
# (settings, skills) is still possible.
.claude/worktrees/
